          "label": "Description",
          "content": "Horizontally repeating gothic-inspired pattern. Large medallions with borders of stylized fleur-de-lis and foliate scrollwork are printed in the middle of the panel. A border of smaller, similar medallions runs across the bottom of the page. An allover diaper pattern is printed behind the scrollwork, and gives the impression of a woven textile. Pattern is printed in reds, greens, tans and yellows atop a brown ground."
